      "raw": "<p>That was fun, and makes me realize I never finished last week's. D:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>I think the big thing I did right was leaving Bugbear for last. With Akash'Thriya being a huge damage sponge and all the potential healing between her and Dr. Medico, it really wasn't hard to deal with ol' Buggy getting big damage buffs from his downed allies. Shielding Winds helped a lot, to say nothing of Perilous Pratfalls. Also, I never saw a single Ball Lightning, but I feel like using a Creeping Mold to knock out Blood Scent made the game a lot easier than it otherwise might have been.</p>",
