      "created_at": "2019-08-06T13:33:16.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Must.... Fight.... Con Crud.....</p>\n<p>Mint with everyone around 90% of full, though we had gotten below 10 a few times. Kill order ended up being Ermine, Bugbear, Plaguerat.</p>\n<p>MVP was creeping mold due to just the sheer number of ongoings I had to burn through before I could start making any progress. Dr Medico and Tempest were healing maniacs and Akash tanked, obviously. I probably should have destroyed Blood Scent earlier than I did, but figured taking 3 damage a round rather than discarding&nbsp;when i was already healing so much anyway was fine.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Good lord can Dr Medico put out a lot of healing if he can keep his ongoings out.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>~Komori&nbsp;</p>",
